  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Convert object-pooling to a CRTP-style PooledObject<T> and update pooled types and usages accordingly. Key changes:\n    - Add generic PooledObject<T> that implements IDisposable and returns instances to LuciferPool.\n    - Change pooled classes (PacketModel, WsModel, Buffer, Utf8Builder, CacheEntry, RateState, SessionEntry, etc.) to inherit PooledObject<T> for type-safe pool returns.\n    - Replace direct Dispose() calls with pool-return calls (Lucifer.Return / LuciferPool.Return) and GC.SuppressFinalize where appropriate (e.g. SimulationManager, HttpModel parsing paths).\n    - Add IDisposable/Dispose implementation for HttpModel<T> to return instances to the pool.\n\n    These changes centralize pool return logic, enforce type safety for pooled types, and reduce incorrect Dispose usage across the codebase.",
